            "review_title": "Review at Jumarc Danang",
            "review_text": "Finnegan D\n32 contributions\n0\nUnique and amazing spot\nApr 2024 • Couples\nIf you are looking for a unique dining spot in Da Nang, this is the place to be. An amazing interior design, great food, music and very nice staff. \nHaving a view on the fishtanks above makes for a great experience!\n\nSpecial thanks to Annie for going the extra mile in serving us the whole night.\n\n100% recommendation!\nWritten April 4, 2024",
