            "review_title": "Review at Jumarc Danang",
            "review_text": "fdeluen\nMontreal, Canada16 contributions\n0\nExcellent food, bar atmosphere\nAug 2023 • Family\nThe food is excellent however it is much more of a bar than a restaurant.\nI don't understand the identity of this bar-restaurant, the drinks menu only consists of wine sold by the bottle. The choice of wine by the glass is only red or white, no grape variety (and no quantity on the menu either). So it's not what I call a bar.\nFor the restaurant part, the music is very loud, it's complicated to get a table and not eat at the bar even if our group (of 3) represented 50% of the customers.\nAs the music is very loud the waitress did not understand my order.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten August 14, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
